{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111679","id":2917211575,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6t4R23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111679","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111679.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111679.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111679","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111679/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111679/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111679/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/a3eb202b2580db3bb30d889fcea7da96fbc85eb9","number":111679,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add support for joypad motion sensors","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/2829\r\nPartially supersedes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/88590\r\nRequires https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111707 to be merged first\r\n\r\nI decided to split my big SDL3 joypad features PR ( https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107967 ) into several smaller PRs, starting with joypad motion sensors.\r\n\r\nThis PR adds the ability to get a joypad's motion sensors (accelerometer, gyroscope) data readings (and also a simulated gravity sensor from the accelerometer and gyroscope data). The reason the gravity sensor had to be simulated: https://github.com/libsdl-org/SDL/issues/6555#issuecomment-1320918918\r\nThis PR also includes the methods to calibrate the motion sensors output. For calibration and gravity calculation, this PR uses https://github.com/JibbSmart/GamepadMotionHelpers\r\n\r\nThis PR was tested on Windows, but it should also work on Linux and macOS.\r\n\r\nTODO:\r\n- [x] Mention that it's recommended to disable the motion sensors if they're no longer needed because it can theoretically drain the controller's battery more quickly\r\n- `InputEventJoypadGyroscope` and `InputEventJoypadAccelerometer` (not sure)\r\n- [x] `Input.get_joy_sensor_rate()`?\r\n- [x] Use GamepadMotionHelpers library for calibration\r\n- [x] Include the accelerometer gravity part in both calibrated and non-calibrated modes (sorry for being indecisive 😅)\r\n- [x] Invert the sensors axes (see also https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113635 )\r\n- [x] Mark the `has_joy_*`, `set_joy_*_enabled` and `is_joy_*_enabled` as experimental (we may or may not need to only enable/disable the motion sensors together in the future, I think)\r\n- [x] Modify the usage example to use 3D nodes\r\n- Accelerometer usage example (not sure it's necessary)\r\n\r\nTODO for separate PRs:\r\n- [ ] Accelerometer/gyroscope events\r\n- ~~Accelerometer events for Input Map (Joypad Accelerometer Up/Down/Left/Right)~~ I got feedback for this idea from Calinou, he suggested not to include those.\r\n- [x] Motion sensors tutorial for the documentation (accelerometer should also be included) ( https://github.com/godotengine/godot-docs/pull/11692 )\r\n\r\nTest project: (EDIT: it currently uses outdated method names)\r\n[joy_motion_sensors_test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24411470/joy_motion_sensors_test.zip)\r\nYou should lay the controller on your desk before running the project, and after \"Calibration is done\" message is printed you can pick up the controller.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310664,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA2NjQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:input","name":"topic:input","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","number":24,"state":"closed","title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.c